      "content": "The correct order of the spin-only magnetic moment of metal ions in the following low-spin\ncomplexes, [V(CN)<sub>6</sub>]<sup>4–</sup>,[Fe(CN)<sub>6</sub>]<sup>4–</sup>, [Ru(NH<sub>3</sub>)<sub>6</sub>]<sup>3+</sup>, and [Cr(NH<sub>3</sub>)<sub>6</sub>]<sup>2+</sup> , is :",
      "options": [
        {
